  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building for Social and Economic Communications IDF Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Communications and Outreach Development grant is to support the development and implementation of a communications strategy.  This strategy will aim to effectively build consensus and support the overall economic reform process. Key activities of the grant will be as follows: a)  An analysis of the government&apos;s institutional capacity to communicate with civil society b)  Establishment of a communications office in the government c)  Support for the preparation of a twelve month communication strategy</narrative>
  </description>
